---
import { companyName } from '../config/site';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-24 sm:py-28">
  <h2 class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-accent uppercase">About</h2>

  <div class="mt-6 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
    <p>
      {companyName} is my independent studio — I build high-quality apps for iPhone and
      iPad. I believe great software should feel effortless: fast, intuitive, and
      respectful of your time and privacy.
    </p>

    <p>
      Every app I ship is designed with intention. I prioritize clarity over clutter,
      thoughtful defaults over endless settings, and experiences that work beautifully
      on day one.
    </p>

    <p>
      I work solo with a long-term mindset: ship carefully, listen closely, and keep
      improving. If you use one of my apps, your feedback directly shapes what I build
      next.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
